                        {
                            "id": 20,
                            "documentId": "bmp06ytkd2iss1w88w39e4y7",
                            "title": "The brown bits left in the pan are the start of a sauce",
                            "description": "Deglaze with a splash of water, wine, or stock while the pan is still hot. Throw in a tablespoon of flour to make gravy. What looks like a mess is concentrated flavor.",
